{
  "key": 8711,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Breathing in this refreshing air...\r",
        "It even perks up Pokémon!\n",
        "That’s why I’m out here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, traveling Trainer.\r",
        "There’s no Gym in this town. You’ll\n",
        "be wanting Veilstone or Pastoria."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, traveling Trainer.\n",
        "Take it easy, slow, and casual."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m too little, so I don’t know\n",
        "how to battle very good.\r",
        "The nice Day-Care Lady is raising\n",
        "my Pokémon for me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Every Sunday, I visit the Lost\n",
        "Tower..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "There used to be nothing here but\n",
        "a road that went straight through.\r",
        "Over time, Pokémon and people just\n",
        "gathered, and the town came to be."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "A traveling Trainer, huh?\r",
        "Tell me, how many kinds of Pokémon\n",
        "have you met so far?\r",
        "If you’re a competent Trainer, I’d\n",
        "think you’d’ve met at least fifty.\r",
        "If you haven’t, you ought to go\n",
        "farther abroad and look harder."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Your encounters with Pokémon can\n",
        "be considered your shared history.\r",
        "This here’s a Pokétch app called\n",
        "Pokémon History.\r",
        "Use it to see your history of\n",
        "Pokémon catches.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "You have your history, and every\n",
        "Pokémon has their own history.\r",
        "When the two collide, new drama\n",
        "is born."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Solaceon Town\n",
        "Free of Worry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Day Care\n",
        "Let Us Raise Your Pokémon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1014_T04_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon News Press\n",
        "Wanted: Pro Pokémon Catcher!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}